cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ObjOrthoRender"
abstract: >-
  Render textured 3D OBJ meshes into georeferenced GeoTIFF orthophotos (DOM).
  Features block-wise rendering to bypass GPU memory limits, multiprocessing,
  three merge strategies, hole filling, a Tkinter GUI, and a headless Docker
  image (Xvfb + Mesa) that runs without a discrete GPU.
